<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB RAISES SWISS RE, ZURICH.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB RAISES SWISS RE, ZURICH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB raised its ratings on Zurich Group and Swiss Re to &quot;strong buy&quot;, the investment bank said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>CSFB set price targets of 780 francs for Zurich and 2,875 francs for Swiss Re.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
